      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:SHARD_COLLECT_01",
      "source": "ARNOR SOLDIER: Sir, this is where the lookouts saw one of the objects land.",
      "source_hash": "b3018d86ca0f93bcb61dcd61af3d9d0974220c9f52dcb6b5fa3afcfdc749fcd9",
      "entry_hash": "7dfb3601731b73762e252f63137e7fc503f360e724d68dba4555711e824f187b",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:SHARD_COLLECT_02",
      "source": "ARNOR OFFICER: What is it? Gather it up and we'll take it back to the outpost.",
      "source_hash": "b9a47a172d1e0e6dd95f9e44c72858bcfcdf09fb0362c620d2dcaa10508c209f",
      "entry_hash": "71250d27caafbfde471c81bc0c97232c2731cf25b72f904c6474504fe9971129",
      "protected_tokens": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT:SHARD_COLLECT_03",
      "source": "ARNOR OFFICER: We'll dispatch more patrols to investigate the other areas after we return with the object.",
